{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785401643921", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "关键发现：arXiv 2506.05320 (Ryoo et al., 2025年6月) — “Generalizable, real-time neural decoding with hybrid state-space models” — 这是先前将混合 SSM 应用于神经解码的工作，但它侧重于运动/神经解码，而非特定的脑机接口（intracortical brain-to-text）。现在我有足够的事实支撑了。让我更新待办事项并撰写评论。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "3e482f19-ad05-4d26-b0c6-cf2f0cc2612c", "uuid": "fa24ab36-f613-474d-9139-802b3ac52a4c"}
